l9stk_protection: W4DP-F2's firmware-independent element and the pack path's protection table (record l9stk, MESHSAT-1357).
Desk arithmetic on committed files and makers' sheets; nothing was built, bought or measured. Calculation basis: TI SLVA673A
(Robust Hot Swap Design) equations 4 to 7, its 2.4 on parallel FETs and its 3.1.2.5 and 3.2.2.7 checks, on the LM5069's sheet.

