   Q1/Q2 on board P (CSD17570Q5B, 0.69 mOhm at 10 V, RthJA 50 C/W) 0.711 W each; TJ 111.8 C on its own pad, 147.4 C with both losses through one pad [0.96]  derived: the 150 C factor 1.8 is the CSD18510Q5B's (ASSUMPTION); board P's pads not drawn
   the breaker's FETs (2 x CSD18510Q5B)                           0.247 W each; TJ 101.2 C (case 101.0 C)                    [0.51]  derived (the sheet's RthJA board, IF-2)
   R17 on board A (ROHM GMR100HJAAFD5L00, 5 W)                    2.86 W                                                     [0.57]  printed at 25 C; derating NOT HELD
   R10 on board P (2 mOhm 2512, 2 W)                              1.15 W                                                     [0.57]  printed at 25 C; derating NOT HELD
